(b) if so, the details thereof; and
(c) if not, the reasons therefor?

(a) whether Government is aware of the  incident of man and elephant conflict in Assam particularly in Bodoland Territorial Region (BTR) in the last three years;
(b) if so, the details of measures taken by Government to avoid men and elephant conflict; and
(c) the details of the number of deceased persons in elephant attacks and compensation given to them?

